- .woof/epics/E182/discovery/synthesis/ARCHITECTURE.md — registry, schemas, 9-check inventory, driver loop
- git show HEAD                                        — the actual change under review
- git diff HEAD~1..HEAD --name-only                    — file-level scope check vs story.paths[]
- CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md                                — project conventions

